%%  Example .bib file for student thesis.
%%  Just to some some examples.  A real thesis bibliography should have more entries!

%%  Short identifiers, such as SS90, are used since a thesis probably won't have more than a few hundred references at most.
%%  Note the double "{{" and "}}" around the title fields.  This helps us manually control capitalization.
%%
%%  Arguably a more proper way would be to protect only the part of a title which needs protection.
%%  For example we could use
%%
%%     title = {Mammalian {NUMT} insertion is non-random}
%%
%%  To specifically protect only the abbreviation NUMT.
%%
%%  However I think students will find it easier to simply bracket the entire title with an extra {}

%%  Use -- in numberical ranges like 9073--9088, TeX will typeset that with a longish – instead of the shorter minus sign -
%%  (La)TeX         Output    the exact appearance depends on the fonts used
%%  9073-9088       9073-9088
%%  9073--9088      9073–9088


